  "description": "BlazorFileUpload makes it easy to upload files in Blazor projects. The 9.0 version is only for .NET9.\nUse 8.x version for .NET8, 7.x for .NET7. All new features / bug fixes are for .NET9 version onward.\nBlazorFileUpload now supports multiple file uploads!",
